#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:90
msgid "The ``app`` module is an empty shell which is filled by the Godot Editor during the export process. As such for development, the ``app`` module requires the presence of a manually exported Godot project to run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:93
msgid "Follow these steps to configure and manually export a Godot project to use with the ``app`` module:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:95
msgid "Within the Godot Editor export window, create a new Android export preset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:96
msgid "Enable :ui:`Gradle Build > Use Gradle Build` in the Android export preset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:97
msgid "Set the :ui:`Gradle Build > Export Format` to :ui:`Export AAR`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:98
msgid "Set the :ui:`Export Path` for the generated ``AAR`` to ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java/app/libs/exportedProjectAAR/``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:99
msgid "Make sure :ui:`Package > Show in App Library` is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:100
msgid "Configure any other export options that makes sense for the project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.rst:101
msgid "Click on :button:`Export Project...`, and export the project to the specified ``Export Path``."
msgstr ""

